 ultimate-guitar.com is what I use for the acoustic guitar. But, never say that a bass guitar is easier than any other guitar, you have to have some agile fingers because I played in a ska band which was on of the most fun but most challenging things I have ever done ha. Your fingers must move fast while keeping a steady beat unlike some guitar songs. <br/><br/> Ultimate-guitar.com has great guitar tabs.","sig":"<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/f741d803b0f1a142.gif\"/>"}]}